      "decision": "Product owner approved Module 10 specification and P10 decisions."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "module": "global",
      "decision": "All MVP product module specs are approved. ADR-001 through ADR-005 form the accepted technical baseline; execution cursor moved to Module 01 architecture."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-09-07",
      "module": "visual-redesign",
      "decision": "Owner requested and authorized adaptation of the Notion dark reference throughout Triply and layout research using existing 21st.dev integration. Existing Cursor MCP was verified and four component previews informed implementation. No functional specs, data model, auth or dependencies changed."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-09-07",
      "module": "01-auth-onboarding",
      "decision": "Owner explicitly requested removal of mandatory email verification. Spec v1.1 amendment approved by that request. App gate and resend UI removed; password session validation, onboarding ownership, RLS and password recovery retained. Hosted provider setting still requires owner action because only public project credentials are available."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "global",
      "decision": "Owner requested project-state reconciliation and authorized deploying Triply to a different Vercel account via the owner's browser session."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "global",
      "decision": "Owner authorized production deploy to Vercel account pedrocouto-dsgn; deployed to https://triply-plum.vercel.app from pedrocouto-dsgn/triply main."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "global",
      "decision": "Owner designated pedrocouto-dsgn/triply as the canonical GitHub repository; local origin updated. Owner configured Supabase auth URLs and disabled Confirm email."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "visual-redesign-v2",
      "decision": "Owner requested a full, more visual layout redesign from Refs/ (banners, image cards, carousels with image placeholders, donut and other charts) and chose the dark + orange theme. Design system v2.0 supersedes v1.0. No functional specs, data model, auth or dependencies changed."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "03-destinations-legs",
      "decision": "Owner requested destination image upload (with recommended size hint), real place photos, a route details pop-up and a working route section. Spec 03 amended to v1.1. Owner chose Unsplash as the photo source (new external service; server-only UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY). Additive migration 202610050011 adds stops.image_path and a private destination-images bucket with owner-only policies."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "visual-redesign-v2",
      "decision": "Owner replaced orange with lime green and asked for the layout/colours of the salesforce invoices reference, full-width banners with bottom gradient, and a collapsible sidebar. Design system v2.1."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "visual-redesign-v2",
      "decision": "Owner asked for photos without an API key (Wikipedia used as keyless default, Unsplash optional), removal of the duplicate tab bar, moving trip management to trip settings, and replacing the attention card with a checklist preview (first 5 + 'Ver todas'). Owner reported migration 202610050011 applied."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "04-budget-expenses",
      "decision": "Owner requested a simplified budget: Objetivo / Já temos (saved + paid) / Falta with inline editing, expense cards per category (inline add/edit/paid/remove, custom categories), forecast per destination/category kept with add actions; savings page simplified the same way. Specs 04 and 05 amended. Owner also requested working '+' to insert destinations between/after stops (migration 202610050012), a route map banner (OSM tiles + Nominatim, keyless) and a cover-photo edit button (cover = first destination image)."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "visual-redesign-v2",
      "decision": "Owner confirmed migration 202610050012 applied. Owner requested sidebar welcome + trip list, trimmed trips page buttons, smaller route cards with destination detail page, pin map markers zoomed out, drag-and-drop reorder, and an itinerary filter by destination."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "07-reservations-checklists",
      "decision": "Owner requested in-place checklist ticking on the overview (task fades out), a single checklist page (to do + completed/archived + add) with reservations below, removal of trip status cards from the trips page, and a softer glow on the next-step card."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "visual-redesign-v2",
      "decision": "Owner requested an independent banner image for 'Todas as viagens' (not tied to any destination). Added profiles.trips_banner_path + owner upload policy (migration 202610050013) and /settings/banner. Owner explicitly authorized commit, push of the branch and production deploy on Vercel."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "multi (03, 04, 06, 07, 08)",
      "decision": "Owner requested platform corrections: ticket price on travel legs mirrored into the budget, fix for marking a new expense as paid and paid expenses listed last, optional timezones everywhere, 'Destino final' checkbox without departure, closer route map zoom, fix for document creation/upload plus a 'Ver documento' page with preview and download, task deletion, and task priority (Alta/Média/Baixa, default Alta, sorted by priority). Specs 03 v1.2, 04 v1.2, 06 v1.1, 07 v1.1, 08 v1.1 amended by that request. Additive migration 202610050014 (relaxed timezone checks, checklist priority, one-time backfill of existing ticket prices into the budget). No new dependency or external service."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-05",
      "module": "global",
      "decision": "Owner granted standing authorization: after every change, commit and deploy to Vercel production automatically (push to pedrocouto-dsgn/triply main, which triggers the Vercel Git integration). Owner reported migration 202610050014 applied."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-06",
      "module": "multi (03, 04, 08)",
      "decision": "Owner reported paid-marking error 42703 and failing document uploads, and requested a ticket-details pop-up on route transport cards. Root causes: validate_financial_record() referenced paid_on/adjusted_on for all tables; Storage upload (INSERT ... RETURNING) needed a SELECT policy covering not-yet-linked objects (confirmed via Supabase storage log: AccessDenied, RLS). Migration 202610060015 replaces the trigger function and adds an owner-folder select policy on trip-documents (bucket remains private)."
    }
  ],
